00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:30.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I -- Because
I've been working, at least,

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.491 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I feel like, you know,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know how to talk
