00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:37.931 line:92%
so I got that part covered

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I just got to figure out
you know,

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.602 size:88% position:44% line:92%
things to wear in public

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:45.171 line:92%
and how to do my hair or my --

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my makeup,
and I'll be good to go.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now,
we've mentioned this before.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you -- Before
you were in show business,

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.582 size:88% position:44% line:92%
you worked as a chemist.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:59.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
And has this been exciting
watching chemistry

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
be such a huge part of our lif
this last year

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:07.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the creation of
and rollout of vaccines?

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:10.730
-Well, the exciting part i
when people actually believe it.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:14.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "Thank God. You'r
going to get the vaccine."

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:18.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I don't believe --
I don't know yet if I'm full

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:23.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
invested in the system of,
you know, giving out the shots

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:26.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because everybody's saying
you know,

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:27.947 line:92%
their appointment was canceled

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:31.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
or they ran out of vaccine
and that sort of thing.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:34.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I don't put my trust
in that system.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:36.256 line:92%
I've -- I've gotten vaccinated

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:38.725
and I was lucky enough
to get Johnson &amp; Johnson.

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:40.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I don't have to
worry about --

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because that was my fear.
I was like,

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:44.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm going to be mad
if I get the first shot,

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:47.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I schedule
the second and..."

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:50.803
Because in my head I'm like,
if I don't get it to the hour,

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:54.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, 24 hours within,
it's not going to work.

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:56.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know better than that.
-Was it exhilarating?

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you feel exhilarated
and relief

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:02.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
