00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:47.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
They knew chemistry
was just a holdover.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.129 size:75% position:38% line:92%
They -- They came --

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:53.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
They would come to my shows.
It was so, so sad.

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:55.668
Because, you know, the --
when you first start out

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:59.973
in comedy, you know, you'r
not killin' it all the time.

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.974 line:92%
So they would come and sit

00:04:00.974 --> 00:04:03.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I remember
being so, so nervous.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:08.681 line:92%
And I drank a six-pack of --

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:11.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
Uh, what's that Ice?
The first Ice...

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
-...drink that came out.

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.020 size:78% position:39%
I can't even remember
what it was called,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.089
