-None -- None of the Ices

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:19.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
were particularly good
to drink six of.

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:21.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
Well, they didn't last, either

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:24.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was --
You know, to calm my nerves.

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.934 size:78% position:39% line:92%
