00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:23.089
-I see. Gotcha.
-So, I've done that a few times,

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:24.857 line:92%
but this was the first tim

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:28.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I actually took it ou
